Z||000000||Double07||09-15-2000||08:51 PM||||What should my timing be?  I have a 86 Fiero V6 4 speed||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||09-15-2000||10:54 PM||||Follow the guidelines on your VECI (Vehicle Emissions Control Information)label under the hood.  The timing should be the average timing figures of the #1 and # 4 cylinders.  Make sure you read your Haynes manual on how to set the timing.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Double07||09-16-2000||09:16 AM||||The reason why I ask what the timing should be is because I dont have the VECI label on the car. Can anyone tell me what the timing should be?||||reg||1
Z||000003||StuGood||09-16-2000||01:00 PM||||10 degrees BTDC (average cyl #1 & #4), with ALCL pins A & B connected together.||||reg||1
